  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Benzotriazole&nbsp;can be prepared by treating o-phenylenediamine with nitrous acid (liberated during the reaction between sodium nitrite and acetic acid) to form mono-diazonium salt that follows spontaneous intramolecular cyclization reaction to produce benzotriazole.<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/19b16302-9081-433c-9f48-8e303f4cc769-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 278px;\" /></p>",
